    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ever wanted to save the galaxy and fall in love? Now\u2019s your chance.</i></strong>  <strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wild mix of rogue-like action, Visual Novel storytelling, and unapologetic adult content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of <strong>ACE</strong> \u2013 engineer by day, vigilante by night. Lead a team of badass heroines, build a killer mech, and fight to save the galaxy from total destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Flirt, seduce, and get tangled up in unforgettable romances with the galaxy\u2019s hottest babes. Whether you\u2019re facing off against deadly enemies or navigating the thrill of forbidden love, <strong>Eden Survivors</strong> delivers an adventure that\u2019s as intense as it is seductive.<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/1758e0a364b09d22e2cb95e95606dd09.poster.avif?t=1748090190\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/1758e0a364b09d22e2cb95e95606dd09.webm?t=1748090190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/1758e0a364b09d22e2cb95e95606dd09.mp4?t=1748090190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80,000 Words of Narrative Feast</strong>: Romance, mystery, and intergalactic chaos\u2014it\u2019s like your favorite space opera but with more steamy moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance and Relationships</strong>: Every heroine brings her own unique skills and story to the table. Flirt, chat, and gift your way into their hearts. (or at least their good side)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/734b1b18fe7a850de417c77e20a5c0aa.poster.avif?t=1748090190\" width=610 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/734b1b18fe7a850de417c77e20a5c0aa.webm?t=1748090190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/734b1b18fe7a850de417c77e20a5c0aa.mp4?t=1748090190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're not fighting monsters, you\u2019re managing the galaxy\u2019s coolest hangout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Eden Bar</strong>: Your home base for adventure, intrigue, and some seriously questionable decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategize Like a Pro</strong>: Attract patrons, rake in profits, and unlock more heroines. Every choice matters\u2014no pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make It Personal</strong>: Flirt with your squad, uncover their secrets, and unlock special events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/117676c0eac83a984781bb8033bd26c5.poster.avif?t=1748090190\" width=610 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/117676c0eac83a984781bb8033bd26c5.webm?t=1748090190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/117676c0eac83a984781bb8033bd26c5.mp4?t=1748090190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit up, Commander. Things are about to get hot!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech Customization</strong>: Assign your heroines, stack over 500+ upgrades in different builds, and create combos so OP they\u2019ll make the devs blush.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>140 Monsters, 30 Levels, 40 Bosses</strong>: From space bugs to galaxy-crushing titans, every chapter is a new challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/b45b6ef73d75d8b407701a6a17052b5b.poster.avif?t=1748090190\" width=610 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/b45b6ef73d75d8b407701a6a17052b5b.webm?t=1748090190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/b45b6ef73d75d8b407701a6a17052b5b.mp4?t=1748090190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clash Mode</strong>: Take on epic bosses in ranked multiplayer. Start in Iron and grind your way to the Master division. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Game Modes</strong>: Got stuck on the main story? Plenty more action to be had: trial mode, skill trees, unique daily and weekly events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/7210a6c96e4d755cc965e4beaa97ad18.poster.avif?t=1748090190\" width=610 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/7210a6c96e4d755cc965e4beaa97ad18.webm?t=1748090190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019990/extras/7210a6c96e4d755cc965e4beaa97ad18.mp4?t=1748090190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what kind of player are you? The <strong>tactician</strong>, meticulously crafting the perfect mech? The <strong>storyteller</strong>, unraveling romances and galactic intrigue? Or maybe the <strong>stud</strong>, here to conquer hearts as well as the galaxy? Or maybe all three?<br><br>Whatever your style, <i>Eden Survivors</i> has you covered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit up, Commander!</p></li></ul>",
