o></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what kind of player are you? The <strong>tactician</strong>, meticulously crafting the perfect mech? The <strong>storyteller</strong>, unraveling romances and galactic intrigue? Or maybe the <strong>stud</strong>, here to conquer hearts as well as the galaxy? Or maybe all three?<br><br>Whatever your style, <i>Eden Survivors</i> has you covered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit up, Commander!</p></li></ul>",
